# CG

Display name is **CG** (broadcast Character Generator). Keep it. Do **not** rename to Overlay, Graphics, GFX, Live, Board, or Item.

This is the locked vocabulary for code, UI copy, DB, routes, and the subdomain. If a new Element needs a payload key, add it under `payload` jsonb — do not invent a parallel table or a second token scheme.

| Surface | Locked name |
|---|---|
| Launcher / `tyapp_app_feature.name` | `CG` |
| Route | `/cg` (`/cg/list`, `/cg/new`, `/cg/edit/:id`, `/cg/edit/:id/layer/:layerId`) |
| Overlay path | `/o/:token` on the CG host; fallback `/cg-live/:token` on Jaxfr |
| Subdomain | `cg` → `https://cg.tszyin.com` / `http://cg.localhost:4200` |
| Code | `features/cg/`, `apps/cg/` (overlay), `core/domains/cg/` |
| Panel files | `cg-package-edit.*` (skeleton is `*-edit`; the page is still Panel) |
| Layer config | `cg-layer-edit.*` at `/cg/edit/:id/layer/:layerId` |

## UI words

| Word | Means | Example |
|---|---|---|
| **Package** | One look to use together | CH36, News SNG |
| **Element** | Kind in the catalog (code registry `CG_ELEMENT_CATALOG`) | Logo, Clock, Ticker |
| **Layer** | One instance inside a Package | CH36's Logo |
| **Panel** | This Package's operator page | Drive-style grid of Layers + On/Off toggle |
| **Output** | OBS URL (full-frame transparent Stage) | Package Output (default), Layer Output |
| **Stage** | 16:9 canvas | Tile thumbs, small program preview, overlay |

**Channel / Source** stay on the Package as `role`. Clock is not Timer. Overlay is the public page implementation, not a product noun.

## Tables and columns (final)

`tyapp_cg_package` PK `tb_tyapp_cgpk_id` (seq `tb_tyapp_cgpk_seq_no`):

`name`, `role` (`channel` \| `source`), `public_token`, `duration_ms` (`0` = cut, default `400` = fade), `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`

`tyapp_cg_layer` PK `tb_tyapp_cgly_id` (seq `tb_tyapp_cgly_seq_no`):

`package_id` → package PK, `element_type`, `public_token`, `layout` jsonb, `payload` jsonb, `visible` (On/Off), `sort_order`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`

Layout jsonb: `x`, `y`, `unit` (`percent` \| `px`), `anchor`, `scale`, `width`, `height`

Logo payload jsonb: `imageUrl`, `fileName`

Tokens share one `/o/:token` space (unique across both tables in practice). Do not add a token table.

RPCs: `tyapp_cg_package_soft_delete_single_record`, `tyapp_cg_layer_soft_delete_single_record`, `tyapp_cg_get_output_by_token`.

**Save** writes the Package and applies it to Output. Each Layer **fades in or out on its own** using the Package `duration_ms` (`0` = cut). Layers that did not change stay put — turning Weather On does not blink an already-On Logo. Panel Stage is a live preview; it does not go to air until Save. On/Off on the Panel is draft until Save.

Do not revive `tyapp_cg_slot` or `component_type`.
